{
  "storyId": "B-da5b",
  "name": "post-done-heartbeat-orphan-worktree",
  "title": "Prevent post-DONE activity heartbeat from recreating removed story worktree directories",
  "description": "Fix the post-DONE activity heartbeat orphan-worktree bug observed during the B-c9f5 dirty-gate series wrap-up on 2026-05-15. The original field symptom was five DONE stories leaving .worktrees/<storyId>/ directories that contained only runtime activity logs after git worktree remove. The current implementation already has a partial guard; this story will make the guard explicit and regression-tested so story_advance DONE cannot recreate a removed worktree directory when the final activity log is written. Priority remains high because the story touches story_advance/worktree cleanup lifecycle behavior, even though the original observed severity was low and doctor can detect/repair old residue.",
